k\">παρά</span> or <span class=\"gk\">ὑπό τινος</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plb.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.69.1</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Phylarch.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">24J.</span> </span>, cf. Vett. Val.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">65.3</span> </span>: c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">πιστευθέντας τοῖς ἐχθροῖς διαφθείρειν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pol.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1287a39</span> </span> (nisi leg.<span class=\"gk\">πεισθέντας</span>): c. gen., <span class=\"gk\">πιστευθεὶς τῆς Κύπρου</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plb.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.55.6</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.56.13</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.S.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.15</span> </span>, etc.</div></div>"}